proton-autogen (3.2.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Thanks to all users and contributors for their continued support, feedback and bug reports.
  * Added automatic Steam AppID fallback detection using an internal executable database, improving compatibility for standalone, backup and non-Steam installations.
  * Improved Steam integration by exporting SteamOverlayGameId, allowing better Steam Overlay compatibility in more launch scenarios.
  * Improved GoldSrc, Source and other legacy OpenGL engine compatibility through automatic renderer detection and adaptive Mesa/OpenGL compatibility settings.
  * Improved legacy DirectX/OpenGL detection by refining renderer heuristics and avoiding unnecessary compatibility workarounds on modern OpenGL applications.
  * Improved Valve engine compatibility and enabled DXVK HUD support for Valve-specific profiles.
  * Added AMD_VULKAN_ICD environment variable documentation to the built-in environment variable reference.
  * Replaced console print statements with the structured logging system across profile modules, providing more consistent debugging and cleaner runtime output.
  * Improved debug logging with additional Steam environment variables and more detailed Wine debugging information.
  * Removed obsolete experimental GoldSrc test profile and consolidated legacy compatibility profiles.
  * Reorganized and cleaned profile definitions and internal architecture for easier maintenance.
  * Updated project documentation, roadmap and README.
  * General compatibility improvements, logging enhancements and code cleanup.

 -- N3oray <n3oray77@gmail.com>  Tue, 04 Aug 2026 22:00:00 +0200
